这是一款在 QGIS 内运行的 AI 助手插件。\n\n• 在底部输入框直接描述:
An AI assistant that runs inside QGIS.

• Describe a GIS task right in the box at the bottom (e.g. “reproject the layer to WGS84”);
• PyQGIS code always asks for confirmation first — tick “Always allow” to stop being asked;
• The PyQGIS API index is built in the background on first run (about 10-30 s, the UI stays responsive);
• Press “Stop” any time while sending — the conversation stays usable afterwards.

See the Help tab for more (the “?” in the top-right of the chat).
